1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,280
Cross your wrists,

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,090
clasp,

3
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,000
roll them in.

4
00:00:03,046 --> 00:00:03,606
Now wiggle

5
00:00:03,606 --> 00:00:04,867
THIS finger!

6
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,096
Wrong one?

7
00:00:06,116 --> 00:00:07,767
You moved its twin...

8
00:00:07,809 --> 00:00:09,767
on the OTHER hand.

9
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,688
Try this one.

10
00:00:10,688 --> 00:00:12,133
And THIS one!

11
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:14,006
It's on your LEFT...

12
00:00:14,006 --> 00:00:15,173
so your brain calls your

13
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:16,167
LEFT hand.

14
00:00:16,192 --> 00:00:17,633
You crossed them.

15
00:00:18,558 --> 00:00:19,243
But if someone

16
00:00:19,243 --> 00:00:20,233
TOUCHES it...

17
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:23,233
you almost never miss.

18
00:00:23,289 --> 00:00:24,650
Your skin knows.

19
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,800
Your eyes just guess.

20
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:27,493
Now try it

21
00:00:27,493 --> 00:00:28,830
on a friend.

